      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 !mb-0">Create, scope, and rotate the key the MCP server authenticates with.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/api/reference" class="block rounded-xl border border-slate-800 p-5 transition-colors hover:border-violet-500/50">
